<!-- SCRUM-449 PROD release package. DevOps-Agent 2026-10-17.

     House pattern: scr414-prod-release.xml / scr413-prod-release.xml (one manifest
     per Prod release, named scrNNN-prod-release.xml).

     Measured Prod-Org state on 2026-10-17 (queries below, all -o Prod-Org):
       FieldDefinition Opportunity (6 risk fields)          -> 6 rows  (live)
       ApexClass OpportunityRisk* / SCRUM449*               -> 5 rows  (live)
       ApexTrigger OpportunityRiskTrigger                   -> 1 row   (live)
       PermissionSet SCRUM449%                              -> 2 rows  (live)
       Report Sales/Hoeh_Risk_Chancen                       -> 1 row   (live)
       Layout Opportunity-Opportunity Layout (6 risk fields)-> live
       ListView Opportunity.Hoeh_Risk_Chancen               -> 0 rows  (MISSING)

     So the package carries the WHOLE feature (redeploying the already-live parts is
     an update, not a new component) and closes the one real gap: the AC12 list view.
     Nothing is excluded: no component of this ticket references a field that is
     absent from Prod (unlike scr414, whose Is_Inactive__c had no Prod counterpart).
     Version 67.0 = the CLI's own metadataRegistry version, copied from the
     per-phase manifests that already deployed from this repo.
-->
